WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.595
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Digital Drain Reflection.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:17.191
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.191 --> 00:00:19.948
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:22.705
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:30.977
Tablet time is ending. The screens are going to sleep, and we have a quiet minute.

00:00:30.977 --> 00:00:39.249
This minute is for noticing: how does your body feel, right after screen time?

00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:44.763
No good answers, no bad answers. We just notice, like scientists of ourselves.

00:00:44.763 --> 00:00:48.440
Let's look, gently, together.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:57.631
How do your eyes feel? Tired and sleepy, or bright and fine? Both are okay to notice.

00:00:57.631 --> 00:01:04.064
How does your body feel? Wiggly, wanting to move — or still and calm?

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:12.336
How does your brain feel? Buzzy, like a busy bee — or quiet, like a pond?

00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:21.527
Those are signals, not grades. Your body is just telling you how it is.

00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:31.637
Now name your battery, honestly: low, full, or somewhere in-between.

00:01:31.637 --> 00:01:37.151
Every battery is a fine battery. Mine feels in-between today. Yours is yours.

00:01:37.151 --> 00:01:43.585
If your battery could use a charge, pick one recharger: stretch tall… sip some water…

00:01:43.585 --> 00:01:49.100
…look out the window at the farthest thing you can see… or take three slow breaths with me.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:55.533
Let's recharge together. If you picked the breaths, breathe with me: in… and out. In… and out. In… and out.

00:01:55.533 --> 00:02:02.886
Feel the battery light fill, gently. Not all the way — just a little more than before.

00:02:02.886 --> 00:02:05.643
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:05.643 --> 00:02:09.320
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:12.996
You're ready for what's next.
